WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.008 --> 00:00:16.192
"I caught a minnow!" Jeremy said.

2
00:00:16.193 --> 00:00:21.633
He started to pull in his line.

3
00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:24.527
But the hook was stuck on something!

4
00:00:24.528 --> 00:00:30.108
The farmer was across the pond.

5
00:00:30.109 --> 00:00:33.064
Suddenly his line jerked.

6
00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:36.057
"A fish!" the farmer said.

7
00:00:36.058 --> 00:00:45.088
He pulled in his line.

8
00:00:45.089 --> 00:00:50.521
"Ahh!" Jeremy's rod flew into the air.

9
00:00:50.522 --> 00:00:52.633
Jeremy flew with it.

10
00:00:52.634 --> 00:00:56.219
"I didn't catch a minnow," Jeremy said.

11
00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:59.378
"I caught a farmer!"

12
00:00:59.379 --> 00:01:02.389
Jeremy let go of his fishing rod.

13
00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:06.800
He fell down, down, down.

14
00:01:06.801 --> 00:01:09.273
Plop!

15
00:01:09.274 --> 00:01:14.138
Jeremy landed in the farmer's pail.

16
00:01:14.139 --> 00:01:19.003
"Oh no!" Jeremy thought.

17
00:01:19.004 --> 00:01:22.246
He sat very still.

18
00:01:22.247 --> 00:01:24.649
The farmer looked at his line.

19
00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:26.468
"Huh," he said.

20
00:01:26.469 --> 00:01:28.499
"I did not catch a fish.

21
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.185
I caught a hook!"

22
00:01:31.186 --> 00:01:34.150
Jeremy didn't move.

23
00:01:34.151 --> 00:01:38.358
"The farmer must not see me!" he thought.

24
00:01:38.359 --> 00:01:41.430
But Jeremy had another problem.

25
00:01:41.431 --> 00:01:53.314
He was trapped in the pail!
